---
import { projects } from '../../data/projects';
import InteractiveArchitecture from '../InteractiveArchitecture.svelte';
import DrawnLine from '../motion/DrawnLine.astro';
const tool = projects[0]!; const monolith = projects[1]!; const site = projects[2]!;
const streamUrl = 'https://stream.psymariux.dev/';
---
<section id="work" class="projects-scene" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="shell work-intro"><h2 id="work-title">Open it.<br />See how it works.</h2><p>Source-backed work, plus one live surface.<br />Different kinds of proof.</p></div>
  <article class="project-world tool-world" style={`--project:${tool.accent}`} data-scene="tool"><div class="shell"><div class="project-heading"><h3><a href="/work/vs-notrack/">vs-notrack</a><span class="project-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></h3><p>{tool.role}<br />{tool.kind}</p></div><div class="project-body"><div class="project-story"><p class="project-deck">Your editor.<br />Your switches.</p><p>{tool.summary}</p><ul class="tags">{tool.technologies.map(t => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul><a class="primary-link light" href="/work/vs-notrack/">Inspect the decisions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="project-state">Source study. System-modifying scripts, not a privacy promise.</p></div><InteractiveArchitecture client:visible /></div></div></article>
  <article class="project-world monolith-world" style={`--project:${monolith.accent}`} data-scene="monolith"><div class="shell"><div class="project-heading"><h3><a href="/work/monolith/">Monolith</a><span class="project-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></h3><p>Project by fraa2a<br />My role: contributor</p></div><div class="project-body"><div class="signal-diagram" aria-label="Simplified Monolith control relationships"><p class="diagram-label">Source diagram / control side</p><div class="diagram-ui">Desktop UI</div><div class="diagram-wire" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="diagram-rpc">Local RPC<DrawnLine circle /></div><div class="diagram-wire" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="diagram-recorder">Native recorder</div><p>Controls talk. The recorder records.</p></div><div class="project-story"><p class="project-deck">Behind one button,<br />a whole conversation.</p><p>{monolith.summary}</p><ul class="tags">{monolith.technologies.map(t => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul><a class="primary-link" href="/work/monolith/">Follow my contributions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="project-state">Current Tauri / Preact architecture. Historical WinUI / C# changes are identified in the case study.</p></div></div></div></article>
  <article class="project-world stream-world" data-scene="stream"><div class="shell stream-composition"><div class="stream-copy"><p class="stream-kicker">LIVE BUILD / SHIPPED WEBSITE</p><h3><a href={streamUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">stream.<br />psymariux.dev</a><span class="project-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></h3><p class="project-deck">A live web experience,<br />shown as the thing itself.</p><p>I built and shipped this website. It is presented here through the deployed experience itself, not as a public source-code case study.</p><a class="primary-link" href={streamUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open the live site <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="project-state">Built &amp; shipped by me · live website · source code not presented here.</p></div><a class="stream-window" href={streamUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="Open stream.psymariux.dev in a new tab"><span class="stream-window-bar"><span class="stream-window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><code>stream.psymariux.dev</code><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><span class="stream-window-body"><span class="stream-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>LIVE</strong><span>Open the deployed experience.</span></span></a></div></article>
  <article class="project-world site-world" style={`--project:${site.accent}`}><div class="shell site-composition"><div><h3><a href="/work/portfolio/">This thing<br />you’re touching.</a><span class="project-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></h3><p>{site.summary}</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/portfolio/">Take the portfolio apart</a></div><div class="site-recipe"><code>index.astro</code><span>Content first.</span><code>Workspace.svelte</code><span>Play where it matters.</span><code>bun run build</code><span>Static on the other side.</span></div></div></article>
</section>
